---

<section class="space-y-12">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif font-semibold text-[#8B5E3C]">MIJN VISIE</h2>
        <p class="text-lg mt-4 text-gray-300">
            Als hobbyfotograaf in Ter Apel, vertel ik verhalen met schaduwen en licht. Ik hou van het contrast en de stille momenten...
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="group relative aspect-[3/4] rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#8B5E3C]/30 shadow-lg">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x800.png?text=Portfolio+1" alt="Portfolio foto 1" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"/>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">1. Fotografie in Ter Apel</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="group relative aspect-[3/4] rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#8B5E3C]/30 shadow-lg">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x800.png?text=Portfolio+2" alt="Portfolio foto 2" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"/>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">2. Sfeerbeeld Natuur</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="group relative aspect-[3/4] rounded-lg overflow-hidden border-2 border-[#8B5E3C]/30 shadow-lg">
            <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/600x800.png?text=Portfolio+3" alt="Portfolio foto 3" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition duration-300 group-hover:scale-105"/>
            <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 p-4 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 to-transparent">
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-300 font-medium">3. Detailopname</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center pt-8">
        <a href="#" class="inline-block bg-[#8B5E3C] text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-[#A67554] transition shadow-lg">
            VOLLEDIGE PORTFOLIO ONTDEKKEN
        </a>
    </div>
</section>
